### 3.2 Chief Financial Officer & Chief Operating Officer — Vinay Abrol

| Financial year (to 31 Mar) | Base salary | **Total single figure** | Comment |
|---|---|---|---|
| FY2021 | ~£290k (est.) | Not separately disclosed in available sources | Structurally the same profit-share arrangement as the CEO, at a lower participation rate |
